{"id": "en_flash_flood_p1", "total": 62.73, "segments": [{"text": "If you face a flooded highway at night, do not drive blindly into the dark water.", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.1}, {"text": "Mark drives his sedan through the heavy rain while the dark night hides the rising danger.", "start": 4.62, "end": 8.62}, {"text": "Turn Around, Don't Drown is the rule because flood water hides deep holes and washed-out roads.", "start": 9.06, "end": 13.68}, {"text": "One. Mark stops his car immediately when the deep water blocks the lonely highway ahead.", "start": 13.793, "end": 18.72}, {"text": "About 12 inches of moving water can easily carry away most cars on the road.", "start": 19.14, "end": 22.82}, {"text": "Just 6 inches of rushing water can knock an adult off their feet in seconds.", "start": 23.24, "end": 26.84}, {"text": "Two. Mark steps out of his vehicle before the freezing water completely surrounds the doors.", "start": 26.53, "end": 31.58}, {"text": "Three. Mark leaves the car and starts to run away quickly to higher ground.", "start": 31.430000000000003, "end": 35.58}, {"text": "Mark moves past the rising water and reaches the safe hill before the flood strikes.", "start": 36.18, "end": 39.66}, {"text": "He looks back at the highway just as the rushing water completely engulfs his car.", "start": 40.3, "end": 44.02}, {"text": "The official safety advice saves his life from the destructive force of the flash flood.", "start": 44.72, "end": 48.38}, {"text": "It was the perfect plan to escape the rising water on the dark highway.", "start": 48.88, "end": 51.92}, {"text": "There was just one unexpected problem waiting for him in the freezing night.", "start": 52.4, "end": 55.62}, {"text": "Mark realizes his cell phone died in the water and he has no way to call for help.", "start": 56.1, "end": 59.58}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.36], ["you", 0.36, 0.46], ["face", 0.46, 0.68], ["a", 0.68, 0.82], ["flooded", 0.82, 1.14], ["highway", 1.14, 1.42], ["at", 1.42, 1.68], ["nig